3168
02:05:20.948 --> 02:05:24.861
like at what level did that sacrifice now bless my families

3169
02:05:24.861 --> 02:05:27.361
and create more family time because of that sacrifice,

3170
02:05:27.361 --> 02:05:31.032
and so imbalance for a quarter of a year

3171
02:05:31.032 --> 02:05:34.925
