02:05:34.925 --> 02:05:36.637
will create an opportunity for me

3173
02:05:36.637 --> 02:05:37.779
to be more one-
It's a leverage point.

3174
02:05:37.779 --> 02:05:39.579
Yeah, it's a leverage point.
Yeah, yeah.

