3177
02:05:43.209 --> 02:05:46.938
myself being someone who like appreciates suffering

3178
02:05:46.938 --> 02:05:50.258
and I feel like I have a capacity for that as well.

3179
02:05:50.258 --> 02:05:52.175
What happens with me is

3180
02:05:55.928 --> 02:05:58.177
I equate maybe not success,

3181
02:05:58.177 --> 02:06:01.431
but whether I've given my all to something

3182
02:06:01.431 --> 02:06:04.983
is calibrated in lockstep with how much I've suffered.

3183
02:06:04.983 --> 02:06:07.369
So whether it's a book or writing a speech

3184
02:06:07.369 --> 02:06:09.091
or preparing for a pod...

3185
02:06:09.091 --> 02:06:11.693
Whatever it is, it's like, if I haven't suffered,

3186
02:06:11.693 --> 02:06:13.026
