3187
02:06:13.026 --> 02:06:14.815
Like I could work harder on it,

3188
02:06:14.815 --> 02:06:18.013
I could really go down the rabbit hole on this,

3189
02:06:18.013 --> 02:06:19.916
I have to really like feel it

3190
02:06:19.916 --> 02:06:22.989
