3216
02:07:21.829 --> 02:07:23.088
than to try to force it.

3217
02:07:23.088 --> 02:07:26.085
Yeah, everything doesn't have to be harder or a struggle.

3218
02:07:26.085 --> 02:07:27.291
It doesn't have to be.

3219
02:07:27.291 --> 02:07:29.113
That's the thing, right?

3220
